	(text "NIBBLE CARD ALU1 - ALU BIT 1: one bit of the adder/subtractor, AND, OR, XOR"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 15.24 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 3.5 3.5)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f4d2a953-fd9d-4fac-9fa0-1af3954d4717")
	)
	(text "Cell: 2N7000 + 47k pull-up (NMOS, see docs/gate-cell.md).  68 transistors, 40 resistors, 1 LEDs, 100 x 100 mm (docs/cards.md).\nFrom the bus header: A1, B1 (register bits), SUB (1 = subtract), ONE (B replaced by 0001: INC, DEC), F1 F0 (function), EO (1 = drive the result onto the bus).\nTo the bus header: BUS1# (open-drain, active-low: pulled low when the result bit is 1 and EO = 1).\nLinks: carry C1 and zero-so-far ZS0 in from bit 0; C2 and ZS1 out to bit 2.\nF1 F0 = 00: R = A + (B xor SUB) + SUB.   01: R = A and B.   10: R = A or B.   11: R = A xor B.  The four bit cards are this design with the bit baked in."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 45.72 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "f6033712-666d-483f-bb06-8ef881f6ba5e")
	)
	(text "B INPUT: BB = B, or 0001 when ONE=1 (INC, DEC).  Then the conditional invert: XB = BB when SUB=0, NOT BB when SUB=1 (two's complement: A - B = A + NOT B + 1, the +1 is SUB fed into the carry-in)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 165.1 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2 2)
				(bold yes)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "31771261-3218-4bf3-a61a-b4ea67003429")
	)
